/* iPhone clipboard sync (Sources/ClipSync*.swift, ICloudFolder.swift, SyncShortcuts.swift, ClipRemote.swift) */
"iCloud Drive isn't on for this Mac: turn it on in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud." = "此 Mac 未開啟 iCloud 雲碟：請在「系統設定」→「Apple 帳號」→「iCloud」中開啟。";
"Couldn't make the folder in iCloud Drive." = "無法在 iCloud 雲碟中建立檔案夾。";
"A file from the iPhone was too big and was set aside." = "來自 iPhone 的檔案過大，已放到一旁。";
"A file from the iPhone couldn't be read and was set aside." = "來自 iPhone 的檔案無法讀取，已放到一旁。";
"Something from the iPhone wasn't kept: it looks like a password or key, matches an excluded pattern, or is too big." = "來自 iPhone 的一項未保留：它像密碼或密鑰、符合排除的模式，或過大。";
"Couldn't write to the iCloud Drive folder." = "無法寫入 iCloud 雲碟檔案夾。";
