"Cocaine: the clipboard needs a newer Shortcut. On the Mac: Settings → Remote work → iPhone → Send." = "Cocaine：剪貼板需要較新的捷徑。在 Mac 上：設定 → 遠端工作 → iPhone → 傳送。";
"Cocaine: unknown clipboard command." = "Cocaine：未知的剪貼板指令。";
"Cocaine: sending text to this Mac's clipboard is off. On the Mac: Settings → Island → iPhone clipboard sync." = "Cocaine：向此 Mac 剪貼板傳送文字已關閉。在 Mac 上：設定 → 動態島 → 與 iPhone 同步剪貼板。";
"Cocaine: reading this Mac's clipboard from the iPhone is off. On the Mac: Settings → Island → iPhone clipboard sync." = "Cocaine：從 iPhone 讀取此 Mac 的剪貼板已關閉。在 Mac 上：設定 → 動態島 → 與 iPhone 同步剪貼板。";
"Cocaine: too many clipboard requests: wait a minute." = "Cocaine：剪貼板請求過多：請等一分鐘。";
