"Cocaine: the parts didn't match: send it again." = "Cocaine：各部分不相符：請重新傳送。";
"Cocaine: too long for this channel (about 2,000 characters): use “Send to Mac” (iCloud Drive)." = "Cocaine：此通道內容過長（約 2,000 個字元）：請使用「傳送到 Mac」（iCloud 雲碟）。";
"Cocaine: the clipboard history is empty." = "Cocaine：剪貼板歷史為空。";
